<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIA PLACES 8.2 BLN LEVS 45-DAY T-BILLS.</title>
<headline>BULGARIA PLACES 8.2 BLN LEVS 45-DAY T-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry</p>
<p>placed a special issue of 45-day discount T-bills worth 8.2</p>
<p>billion levs and yielding 29.27 percent to maturity, the</p>
<p>central bank said.</p>
<p>In line with its usual practice the central bank did not</p>
<p>say with which financial intitution or institutions the issue</p>
<p>was placed on Friday.</p>
<p>Details of issue follow. Price in percent of par.</p>
<p> Issue number		  BG3025397004</p>
<p> Type			    discount</p>
<p> Term			    45 days</p>
<p> Issue date		    March 28</p>
<p> Maturity date		 May 12</p>
<p> Par value		     8.2 bln levs</p>
<p> Selling price		 77.36 pct</p>
<p> Avg yield to maturity     29.27 pct</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 981 8569</p>
</text>
